# Citation metadata for GitHub's "Cite this repository" (Citation File Format 1.2.0).
# The version is the one of the C++ library and the Python package; the R package carries its own
# version in R/TRexSelector/DESCRIPTION. The method papers are listed as references; the master
# list with every reference of the class documentation is references.bib at the repository root.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the package and the paper of the method you used."
type: software
title: "TRexSelector"
abstract: >-
  High-dimensional variable selection with false discovery rate (FDR) control through terminating
  random experiments (the T-Rex selector) in C++, R and Python.
authors:
  - name: "TRexSelector Team"
version: 1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/trexselector/TRexSelector"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
